AI delayed Power latch:
- Initial valid rally fixture: Power, Hard right AI, charge 5, paddle y=300,
  ball x=1130,y=100,vx=600,vy=0. The real core scores by tick 6 before the delayed
  AI action arrives. The stale action is rejected during point phase.
- Before correction, 240 simulated ticks produced one action at tick 6/point,
  no Power activations, and the AI remained at charge 5 with its request latched.
- Regression added before production change. The existing 12 tests still passed;
