Online latency-probe contracts:
- Matching nonce computes an 80ms value on one fixture clock.
- Null, unknown and wrong-type nonces leave the metric unchanged.
- Superseded callbacks cannot replace the current probe measurement.
- A disposed session cannot change metrics from a late probe callback.

